WEBVTT

01:28.480 --> 01:32.480
Our Secret
EP21

01:39.840 --> 01:40.800
Su,

01:41.010 --> 01:43.050
this original piece by Xianxian

01:43.200 --> 01:44.200
is very good.

01:44.330 --> 01:46.409
We can expand it into 200 episodes.

01:46.439 --> 01:47.370
It won't be a problem.

01:47.800 --> 01:49.800
We can also convert it into an animation,

01:49.969 --> 01:51.010
or a game,

01:51.200 --> 01:52.120
something like that.

01:52.650 --> 01:53.930
Guaranteed to make a hit!

01:54.880 --> 01:55.800
Director Zhang,

01:56.800 --> 01:57.730
I'm sorry.

01:58.880 --> 02:00.439
I can't sign the contract.

02:01.370 --> 02:03.930
Director Zhang, Xianxian has never signed a contract before.

02:04.090 --> 02:06.440
I think she needs some time to think.

02:08.240 --> 02:09.120
Young lady,

02:09.810 --> 02:11.480
you've made a promise.

02:12.090 --> 02:14.090
How can you break it?

02:15.760 --> 02:18.040
I'm really, really sorry.

02:18.890 --> 02:20.930
The artists that I contract with on my comics app

02:20.930 --> 02:23.170
are all very popular on Weibo.

02:23.320 --> 02:26.120
If you refuse to work with me for your own reasons,

02:26.810 --> 02:27.730
when words get out,

02:28.320 --> 02:29.250
what do people think of you?

02:29.320 --> 02:30.009
Director Zhang...

02:32.530 --> 02:33.370
Young lady,

02:33.930 --> 02:36.810
you need to learn right from wrong.

02:38.090 --> 02:38.890
Sign it.

02:45.120 --> 02:46.600
What's right and what's wrong?

02:51.480 --> 02:53.600
Party A and party B.

02:53.960 --> 02:55.170
Collaborating upon mutual consent.

02:55.930 --> 02:58.730
There's no reason for forced signing.

03:03.170 --> 03:04.120
Zhou Siyue.

03:04.370 --> 03:05.400
We're talking about Ding Xian's business here.

03:05.560 --> 03:07.730
I'm also doing this for Director Zhang's sake.

03:08.530 --> 03:11.170
Signing a contract hastily before reaching an agreement,

03:11.560 --> 03:13.960
if anything goes wrong with the project one day,

03:14.560 --> 03:15.290
I don't think you'd want

03:15.480 --> 03:17.600
people to talk about how you made a big mistake, right?

03:18.680 --> 03:19.560
For this piece of work,

03:20.090 --> 03:22.530
its greatest value is in Ding Xian herself.

03:23.040 --> 03:25.320
It's what she's always had in her.

03:26.730 --> 03:28.960
So from a business perspective,

03:29.840 --> 03:30.450
Ding Xian

03:30.930 --> 03:33.730
is not the best commodity for you, Director Zhang.

03:38.890 --> 03:39.650
Come on.

03:40.009 --> 03:40.930
Change your shoes.

03:43.600 --> 03:45.530
Why did you bring a pair of shoes?

03:46.200 --> 03:47.960
I got them by the road on my way here.

03:51.090 --> 03:52.009
It's okay.

03:52.480 --> 03:53.650
You look so good today.

03:54.320 --> 03:55.600
Let me do it.

04:04.400 --> 04:07.200
How did you know my feet hurt?

04:08.810 --> 04:10.400
Because my feet hurt, too.

04:16.040 --> 04:16.650
Do they fit?

04:22.090 --> 04:22.880
Xianxian.

04:31.130 --> 04:32.480
Xianxian, I don't quite understand.

04:33.250 --> 04:34.930
Don't you want other people to look up to you,

04:34.930 --> 04:36.000
make a better life,

04:36.000 --> 04:36.650
and become someone...

04:36.650 --> 04:37.570
Su,

04:39.040 --> 04:41.370
I just want to be the person I want to be.

04:43.410 --> 04:44.970
I thought we were the same kind of people.

04:57.160 --> 04:58.200
We used to be.

05:23.850 --> 05:24.570
Su.

05:25.410 --> 05:26.090
Director Zhang.

05:26.720 --> 05:27.480
I'm sorry.

05:27.480 --> 05:28.530
What happened today...

05:30.090 --> 05:31.000
Don't worry about it.

05:31.320 --> 05:32.720
I've given her the opportunity

05:32.930 --> 05:34.160
for your sake.

05:35.160 --> 05:36.880
I wonder why you help her so much.

05:37.650 --> 05:38.810
If I'm not mistaken,

05:39.410 --> 05:40.810
you like her?

05:43.880 --> 05:45.570
Director Zhang, let me see you to the car.

05:47.570 --> 05:48.320
Su,

05:49.200 --> 05:50.410
women like this

05:51.130 --> 05:53.040
love guys like you,

05:53.040 --> 05:54.320
talented and rich.

05:59.530 --> 06:00.370
Director Zhang,

06:01.600 --> 06:02.570
I'm sorry.

06:02.850 --> 06:04.650
I can't agree with what you said.

06:05.480 --> 06:06.600
About the project this time,

06:07.600 --> 06:08.690
I opt out.

06:15.530 --> 06:16.440
I think

06:16.930 --> 06:19.000
I dreamed of a scene like this.

06:21.410 --> 06:22.530
You dreamed of me?

06:25.130 --> 06:27.720
You were holding my hand like this in my dream.

06:28.760 --> 06:30.850
At that time, I thought,

06:31.040 --> 06:33.480
I'd never be with you.

06:33.720 --> 06:37.320
So I had a lot of dreams about you.

06:38.130 --> 06:39.200
I'm sorry, Ding Xian.

06:41.440 --> 06:42.720
I promise you,

06:43.970 --> 06:46.040
I won't ever hurt you again.

06:48.410 --> 06:49.320
So,

06:49.880 --> 06:53.530
how are you gonna explain to Xing Lufei?

06:54.370 --> 06:55.650
It's none of her business.

06:56.760 --> 06:58.600
She likes you.

06:59.040 --> 07:00.410
It's none of my business.

07:01.130 --> 07:03.200
Then should I talk to her...

07:03.200 --> 07:04.250
It's none of your business.

07:06.410 --> 07:07.280
Zhou Siyue,

07:07.810 --> 07:10.000
you are avoiding my question.

07:13.280 --> 07:14.320
I never thought,

07:15.090 --> 07:15.850
that you would be nervous,

07:15.850 --> 07:17.930
about people like Xing Lufei.

07:19.760 --> 07:20.650
I never thought,

07:21.880 --> 07:25.040
that you would be nervous about people like Su Bocong.

07:25.040 --> 07:26.320
How am I nervous?

07:27.250 --> 07:28.650
You're kidding.

07:31.480 --> 07:33.810
Then who's the one,

07:34.250 --> 07:35.850
feeling insecure just because

07:36.160 --> 07:37.570
I talked a few words with him?

07:45.570 --> 07:48.650
Ding Xian, I used to think,

07:50.480 --> 07:52.370
I know what I want,

07:54.040 --> 07:55.720
but then I found out,

07:56.650 --> 07:59.160
if I don't have you in my world,

08:01.880 --> 08:03.970
then everything is meaningless.

08:07.930 --> 08:09.570
So, on the road ahead,

08:11.040 --> 08:12.480
shall we walk together?

08:16.090 --> 08:17.040
Zhou Siyue,

08:19.970 --> 08:21.370
all these years,

08:23.280 --> 08:25.720
I've never really changed.

08:29.850 --> 08:31.320
If I say yes,

08:33.520 --> 08:35.599
you'll never let me go again.

08:38.890 --> 08:39.810
I promise you.

08:42.250 --> 08:43.400
We will always,

08:44.520 --> 08:46.010
be together.

09:14.770 --> 09:16.400
This is correct, and...

09:16.570 --> 09:17.960
there are sixteen rooms altogether, right?

09:17.960 --> 09:18.570
Right.

09:18.570 --> 09:19.210
And then this...

09:19.890 --> 09:21.010
Zhou Siyue.

09:26.080 --> 09:27.400
Boss, so,

09:27.770 --> 09:28.960
when we were given awards,

09:28.960 --> 09:31.130
this Mr. Chen from Hongguang Technology wanted you to contact him.

09:33.280 --> 09:33.930
Right,

09:34.130 --> 09:36.010
did your idea work?

09:37.770 --> 09:38.520
I figured it out.

09:39.570 --> 09:41.400
The meaning of my life is to eat.

09:42.450 --> 09:44.330
I don't make super big bucks,

09:44.640 --> 09:46.370
why should I work super hard?

09:49.810 --> 09:50.480
Good morning.

09:50.810 --> 09:51.480
Morning.

09:54.160 --> 09:55.840
I'll take it myself.

09:56.450 --> 09:57.370
Just get on the bus.

10:04.130 --> 10:05.010
Hi.

10:18.770 --> 10:19.720
I got it, I got it.

10:20.720 --> 10:21.250
Please sit.

10:35.400 --> 10:36.810
How about I go sit over there?

10:36.810 --> 10:37.640
Just sit here.

10:43.570 --> 10:44.450
Ding Xian,

10:45.210 --> 10:47.450
have you finished the activity report of this Comic-con?

10:47.520 --> 10:49.330
It should be out in our WeChat account today.

10:50.600 --> 10:52.570
When did this become my responsibility?

10:52.960 --> 10:54.010
On our meeting last night.

10:54.160 --> 10:55.720
It was decided on the spot when you were absent.

10:58.130 --> 10:59.720
Okay, I'll do it right away.

11:02.160 --> 11:03.280
It's time to

11:03.280 --> 11:04.570
give the report of the competition, right?

11:05.160 --> 11:06.040
Dong Zhengfei,

11:07.520 --> 11:09.600
you're the team leader but you don't work at all.

11:09.770 --> 11:11.450
Shame on you.

11:11.480 --> 11:12.040
Yuan Fang.

11:13.400 --> 11:15.250
I'll write it. It's okay.

11:15.930 --> 11:17.010
You can get some sleep.

11:17.720 --> 11:18.600
Thank you, Boss.

11:19.080 --> 11:21.890
Could you help me get my bag?

11:29.330 --> 11:30.210
Thank you.

11:40.280 --> 11:41.330
Would you like some music?

12:19.890 --> 12:20.770
I have finished the report.

12:20.960 --> 12:21.890
And you?

12:22.400 --> 12:23.520
Not yet.

12:24.250 --> 12:25.370
You can get some sleep first.

12:25.770 --> 12:26.480
Okay.

13:43.960 --> 13:45.370
I didn't know that Zhou,

13:46.250 --> 13:48.930
could be so gentle and considerate.

13:49.640 --> 13:51.570
Me, neither.

14:14.960 --> 14:15.930
Let's go, Boss.

14:16.520 --> 14:18.010
You can't read social cues at all.

14:27.330 --> 14:28.250
Wake up.

14:35.640 --> 14:36.600
Have we arrived yet?

14:47.450 --> 14:48.400
Hello, Ms. Sun.

14:49.080 --> 14:49.930
Ding Xian.

14:50.450 --> 14:53.600
These last few episodes of "Shadows" are really good.

14:53.960 --> 14:54.960
We thought about it,

14:55.400 --> 14:57.600
and decided to update every three days.

14:58.040 --> 14:58.600
If it's okay,

14:58.690 --> 15:00.640
could you please send me a new draft tonight?

15:01.890 --> 15:03.370
Tonight?

15:03.600 --> 15:05.450
Yes, I want it tonight.

15:05.930 --> 15:06.930
I see.

15:09.770 --> 15:11.210
I'm gonna have to work on my draft.

15:11.640 --> 15:12.690
See you then.

15:21.480 --> 15:23.160
Zhou Siyue, would you like to have dinner together tonight?

15:24.210 --> 15:25.640
It's okay if you don't want to eat. I know that there's a...

15:25.640 --> 15:27.210
Can you stay away from me?

15:27.400 --> 15:28.600
- See you. - See you.

15:31.480 --> 15:32.810
Do you hate me so much?

15:34.690 --> 15:35.960
I've been chasing you for so long.

15:36.450 --> 15:38.520
Anyone can see, if he's not a fool.

15:38.720 --> 15:40.930
Where am I not as good as her?

15:42.570 --> 15:44.480
She is better than you in everything.

15:44.890 --> 15:46.480
You're kidding me.

15:59.640 --> 16:01.450
It was you who locked Ding Xian in the dressing room

16:02.280 --> 16:03.210
the other day, isn't it?

16:08.130 --> 16:09.370
Xing Lufei,

16:10.080 --> 16:11.640
I'm telling you for the last time,

16:13.210 --> 16:15.210
Ding Xian is the only girl I like.

16:25.520 --> 16:26.930
About the thing between you and Director Zhang,

16:27.570 --> 16:28.720
I already heard.

16:29.690 --> 16:31.690
Why were you so impulsive?

16:32.720 --> 16:33.840
I'm sorry, Mr. Ma.

16:34.600 --> 16:36.280
That was my fault.

16:36.640 --> 16:37.890
I'll try to make up for it.

16:41.720 --> 16:42.770
Su,

16:43.160 --> 16:44.450
do you know why,

16:44.640 --> 16:46.160
I chose you before,

16:46.160 --> 16:47.400
and start a business together with you?

16:49.330 --> 16:50.810
Because you're young,

16:51.160 --> 16:52.930
and you already know what you want.

16:53.520 --> 16:54.840
And you're so motivated,

16:55.570 --> 16:58.840
with a calmness beyond your peers.

17:00.370 --> 17:01.770
But now it seems that,

17:02.600 --> 17:03.960
you're still too young.

17:06.160 --> 17:07.570
Mr. Ma, I heard you.

17:09.930 --> 17:10.850
Right.

17:11.039 --> 17:12.210
I have a project at hand,

17:12.490 --> 17:14.690
that needs someone in charge to follow up.

17:15.970 --> 17:17.360
Since you happen to have time,

17:17.570 --> 17:19.450
I'll give this project to you.

17:37.970 --> 17:38.930
Boss,

17:40.520 --> 17:42.120
waiting for Xianxian's message?

17:46.280 --> 17:48.210
I can't believe you've also come to this.

17:48.640 --> 17:50.000
I guess it's fair luck after all.

17:52.240 --> 17:54.000
I don't seem to remember you getting lucky once, have you?

17:55.280 --> 17:57.240
You're so mean!

18:02.400 --> 18:03.400
Professor Ye.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.490
Siyue.

18:05.930 --> 18:07.730
Mr. Chen of Hongguang Technology came to me yesterday.

18:08.210 --> 18:09.730
He's interested in your robot,

18:10.400 --> 18:12.120
and wanted to work with our team.

18:12.360 --> 18:13.850
Mr. Chen of Hongguang Technology?

18:13.850 --> 18:14.400
Right.

18:15.970 --> 18:17.280
I think I kind of remember him.

18:18.210 --> 18:19.160
I remembered.

18:19.850 --> 18:22.090
It was at the last robot contest,

18:22.280 --> 18:23.040
at the award ceremony,

18:23.210 --> 18:25.000
he asked me to hand over his business card to you.

18:27.880 --> 18:29.970
So what exactly does their company do?

18:30.570 --> 18:31.570
You don't know?

18:33.160 --> 18:35.610
Hongguang Technology is currently the most authoritative

18:35.610 --> 18:36.690
intelligent robot company in China.

18:37.210 --> 18:38.640
Their main products are

18:39.040 --> 18:40.450
humanoid intelligent robots.

18:45.210 --> 18:46.120
Professor Ye.

18:47.210 --> 18:48.850
I don't really want to work with them.

18:49.610 --> 18:51.330
Are you out of your mind?

18:51.730 --> 18:54.040
Working with Hongguang is not only profitable,

18:54.280 --> 18:56.280
but also you get to collaborate with the top teams in the country.

18:56.730 --> 18:57.850
You're giving up this great opportunity like this?

18:57.850 --> 18:58.400
What are you thinking?

18:58.400 --> 19:01.120
Indeed, Hongguang Technology is very good.

19:01.690 --> 19:02.280
It might even be

19:02.280 --> 19:04.040
our best option at the moment.

19:04.570 --> 19:05.610
But why,

19:06.000 --> 19:08.610
why does a high-end technology company,

19:09.240 --> 19:11.760
want to work with a team of sophomores?

19:14.690 --> 19:16.400
What's more, the robot technology we have

19:16.610 --> 19:17.490
is not perfected.

19:17.730 --> 19:20.330
It does not have a relatively clear direction for application.

19:20.760 --> 19:21.810
But

19:22.000 --> 19:22.970
that doesn't mean we won't make progress.

19:22.970 --> 19:24.690
So that's the problem.

19:25.160 --> 19:27.640
Obviously they can go to more accomplished teams,

19:27.930 --> 19:29.400
with more mature performance and techniques.

19:30.040 --> 19:32.160
Or wait for us to grow,

19:32.160 --> 19:33.280
and then come and cooperate with us.

19:33.850 --> 19:36.040
With the timing that they come to us,

19:36.810 --> 19:38.570
I suspect that the cooperation is just an excuse.

19:38.850 --> 19:39.520
Their real purpose

19:39.690 --> 19:41.090
is to buy out our patents.

19:41.970 --> 19:43.970
But a buy-out of our patents,

19:44.160 --> 19:46.210
doesn't sound like a bad thing currently, does it?

19:46.400 --> 19:48.040
When we're not sure about whether we share

19:48.210 --> 19:50.090
similar ideas for a cooperation,

19:50.490 --> 19:51.930
selling out our patents would mean,

19:52.330 --> 19:54.040
that we hand over the results

19:54.210 --> 19:55.330
of our year-long research.

19:56.160 --> 19:57.120
Are you willing to do that?

19:58.490 --> 19:59.210
Professor Ye.

19:59.450 --> 20:01.210
I think you should reconsider it.

20:01.610 --> 20:02.730
If Zhou Siyue's not willing to,

20:03.120 --> 20:05.120
I can lead our team and work with Hongguang.

20:08.280 --> 20:09.400
I'll think about it.

20:12.120 --> 20:13.090
Bye, Professor.

20:36.040 --> 20:37.240
After a whole night of working on my draft,

20:37.240 --> 20:39.640
it's so nice to finally get to enjoy some nice food.

20:40.120 --> 20:41.000
Aren't you tired?

20:42.880 --> 20:43.690
Not really.

20:44.400 --> 20:46.160
I like drawing.

20:46.570 --> 20:47.450
So I'm not tired.

20:48.730 --> 20:49.880
It's just...

20:50.280 --> 20:51.210
I ate too much.

20:52.000 --> 20:53.210
Too much?

20:53.610 --> 20:55.570
You ate too much, but you're still buying so many snacks?

20:57.240 --> 20:58.160
For a girl,

20:58.360 --> 21:00.880
we don't use the same stomach for eating dinner and eating snacks.

21:06.210 --> 21:07.280
Is there anything else you want to eat?

21:09.970 --> 21:11.240
I want ice cream.

21:11.760 --> 21:12.970
Isn't that cold?

21:14.330 --> 21:16.730
I'll just take a bite if you buy one.

21:17.330 --> 21:18.280
What about the rest?

21:19.690 --> 21:20.490
You'll finish it.

21:21.330 --> 21:22.490
No I'm not.

21:23.610 --> 21:25.450
Come on!

21:26.490 --> 21:27.690
What flavor do you want?

21:29.240 --> 21:30.360
Blueberry.

21:30.760 --> 21:31.930
Blueberry.

21:38.970 --> 21:39.850
It's so cold.

21:41.210 --> 21:42.330
Just don't eat if it's cold.

21:43.120 --> 21:45.000
No, this is delicious.

21:45.000 --> 21:46.280
Can't be wasted.

21:49.280 --> 21:50.210
Would you like some?

21:50.640 --> 21:52.120
No, it's all yours.

21:52.730 --> 21:53.970
You don't want to eat my leftover?

22:05.360 --> 22:06.330
It's so cold.

22:06.570 --> 22:07.450
Isn't it delicious?

22:08.850 --> 22:09.810
It is good.

22:19.880 --> 22:21.160
I have work to do in my lab.

22:21.610 --> 22:22.810
Why don't you go back first?

22:24.400 --> 22:25.930
So I'll go back to the studio then.

22:26.240 --> 22:27.040
Okay.

22:31.160 --> 22:32.210
See you.

22:48.400 --> 22:49.880
You shouldn't come see her anymore.

22:52.360 --> 22:53.610
What if I'm here for you?

22:55.850 --> 22:57.880
This is a young team from Hua Qing.

22:58.280 --> 23:00.240
They just won the championship in the robot contest.

23:00.490 --> 23:02.040
And they were targeted by Hongguang.

23:02.520 --> 23:03.970
You should get in touch with them.

23:04.160 --> 23:04.970
Talk to them.

23:05.520 --> 23:06.610
Do you want to,

23:07.360 --> 23:08.760
scout them?

23:09.000 --> 23:10.040
It's not them that I want.

23:10.810 --> 23:14.330
I want to know what Hongguang's been up to.

23:15.970 --> 23:16.850
Oh,

23:17.330 --> 23:18.810
I have this document here,

23:19.400 --> 23:21.160
that's maybe of help to you.

23:23.810 --> 23:25.640
I'm flattered,

23:28.040 --> 23:29.610
but I'm just a student.

23:29.880 --> 23:32.690
I'm not planning on working with any company just yet.

23:33.280 --> 23:34.520
Not working with us,

23:37.210 --> 23:38.880
but working with Hongguang.

23:39.810 --> 23:42.330
You want me to hack information from Hongguang?

23:48.400 --> 23:49.810
I didn't expect you people can

23:50.730 --> 23:52.970
do anything by fair means or foul just for making money.

23:54.690 --> 23:56.930
I still hope that you could consider.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.970
There's no need for further discussion between us.

24:00.210 --> 24:02.400
I won't do anything illegal.

24:03.850 --> 24:05.880
You'd be embarrassing yourself.

24:08.000 --> 24:09.210
Why don't you take a look at this before you make a decision?

24:27.360 --> 24:28.610
With your health situation,

24:28.970 --> 24:31.450
I keep telling you to walk outside more often, and you just wouldn't listen.

24:31.810 --> 24:33.330
You'd rather stay in the room.

24:34.120 --> 24:35.400
Whenever I walk around,

24:35.400 --> 24:37.160
my brain will be packed with ideas.

24:38.210 --> 24:41.090
Reading brings me some peace.

24:47.040 --> 24:49.160
I won't do anything illegal.

24:49.450 --> 24:51.360
You'd be embarrassing yourself.

24:52.760 --> 24:54.280
Why don't you take a look at this before you decide?

24:58.000 --> 24:58.810
We've found out

24:58.970 --> 25:01.090
the man who set your father up.

25:15.450 --> 25:16.400
Siyue, you're here.

25:19.210 --> 25:20.280
No classes at school?

25:20.850 --> 25:22.490
Class is over.

25:23.000 --> 25:23.690
Here.

25:31.850 --> 25:32.810
Are you feeling any better?

25:33.040 --> 25:33.880
Much better.

25:34.880 --> 25:35.850
I heard that,

25:36.730 --> 25:38.690
you won a prize again.

25:39.570 --> 25:40.570
Well done.

25:41.730 --> 25:43.880
That's because of your teachings.

25:44.120 --> 25:45.330
Here, have some water.

25:52.930 --> 25:54.120
I'm sorry, dad.

25:55.970 --> 25:57.400
What, you're in trouble?

25:58.880 --> 25:59.690
I'm just...

26:01.210 --> 26:03.450
sorry that I got you worried.

26:09.970 --> 26:11.690
Your mom and I know,

26:11.970 --> 26:13.240
that you're always

26:13.400 --> 26:15.240
a very good boy.

26:16.120 --> 26:19.000
We never worry about you making mistakes.

26:20.090 --> 26:21.360
Whatever you want to do,

26:21.850 --> 26:24.610
just go ahead and do it.

26:24.610 --> 26:25.810
Don't worry.

26:27.520 --> 26:29.160
But what if that thing

26:29.850 --> 26:31.930
takes sacrifices?

26:32.610 --> 26:33.880
It always takes sacrifices.

26:33.970 --> 26:34.930
Doesn't it?

26:36.280 --> 26:38.160
If it didn't happen to us,

26:38.850 --> 26:39.970
I never knew,

26:41.360 --> 26:42.450
that we,

26:42.850 --> 26:44.330
could be such a happy family.

26:48.090 --> 26:49.330
Mark my words,

26:49.880 --> 26:51.120
no matter what happens,

26:51.850 --> 26:54.450
as long as think it through for yourself, go for it.

26:58.690 --> 27:00.520
I have no regrets.

27:01.090 --> 27:02.690
I just want my son,

27:03.280 --> 27:04.690
to have no regrets, either.

27:08.400 --> 27:09.880
You're gonna recover.

27:11.000 --> 27:12.000
I will.

27:22.330 --> 27:23.490
It's such a simple thing.

27:23.690 --> 27:25.240
Have you even put any effort in it?

27:31.120 --> 27:32.730
It's so great to be rich.

27:33.970 --> 27:35.690
You can even buy the truth.

27:41.000 --> 27:42.450
But I still refuse.

27:45.210 --> 27:46.120
You won't do it now,

27:46.120 --> 27:47.850
but it doesn't mean you won't do it in the future.

27:52.090 --> 27:54.040
She loves you for your honesty and integrity now,

27:55.450 --> 27:57.730
but one day you're gonna bow before reality.

27:58.450 --> 27:59.570
By that time,

28:00.450 --> 28:01.520
do you think,

28:03.160 --> 28:04.810
that she'll still love you?

28:10.730 --> 28:12.930
I am not the same kind of person like you.

28:35.450 --> 28:36.450
For me?

28:38.730 --> 28:40.280
Now that the shoes are delivered,

28:40.570 --> 28:41.570
I'll see you later.

28:45.160 --> 28:46.210
What's the rush?

28:54.610 --> 28:55.610
Let's take a look.

29:09.760 --> 29:10.520
How do you like them?

29:12.850 --> 29:13.730
Not bad.

29:14.520 --> 29:15.810
You've got eyes for these.

29:16.730 --> 29:17.640
Of course.

29:17.730 --> 29:19.400
You gotta see who bought them.

29:32.000 --> 29:33.760
Why did you transfer so much?

29:34.640 --> 29:35.930
Of course.

29:36.280 --> 29:37.520
I can't take advantage of you.

29:39.760 --> 29:40.690
Then forget it.

29:40.880 --> 29:41.880
I can't take this.

29:43.640 --> 29:45.040
I've earned money lately.

29:45.520 --> 29:47.640
I got paid 4,000 yuan for this draft.

29:49.610 --> 29:52.040
I feel it's easy for me to make money.

29:53.000 --> 29:55.850
How about this? In the future, you stay home,

29:56.090 --> 29:57.880
and I'll go earn the bread.

29:59.760 --> 30:00.970
You see, you've been so busy lately.

30:02.930 --> 30:04.450
I feel bad for you.

30:05.040 --> 30:06.330
Look at that smug face of yours.

30:06.850 --> 30:08.730
Happy about earning this little money.

30:09.240 --> 30:11.330
4,000 yuan is not a little.

30:11.970 --> 30:12.850
Plus,

30:13.360 --> 30:15.610
I earn money with my own hands.

30:16.490 --> 30:17.810
I don't cheat or

30:18.000 --> 30:19.610
compromise to the reality.

30:27.490 --> 30:28.810
Let me ask you a question.

30:31.210 --> 30:32.120
What if...

30:35.570 --> 30:37.330
one day you found me changed

30:38.450 --> 30:39.970
into a person not knowing right from wrong,

30:42.970 --> 30:43.970
what would you do?

30:45.970 --> 30:47.810
Why are you asking that?

30:48.760 --> 30:50.810
Are you in a bad mood?

30:54.570 --> 30:55.490
No.

30:59.040 --> 30:59.930
So?

31:00.610 --> 31:02.090
Is it because of the contest?

31:03.400 --> 31:04.160
No.

31:07.330 --> 31:08.330
Your experiment?

31:09.040 --> 31:10.810
I asked you first,

31:11.160 --> 31:12.090
you gotta answer me first.

31:13.490 --> 31:15.570
Don't forget to stay true to yourself.

31:16.930 --> 31:18.640
I can't imagine

31:19.730 --> 31:21.760
what you would be like if you change.

31:31.850 --> 31:32.690
Hello.

31:32.760 --> 31:34.280
Ding Xian, we've got some copyright issue

31:34.280 --> 31:35.490
with the novel adapted from your comics.

31:39.000 --> 31:39.640
Director Su,

31:39.640 --> 31:41.880
about that blogger of the "Little Monster Diaries",

31:41.970 --> 31:43.160
I think she's in trouble.

31:56.730 --> 31:57.690
Hello, Director Sun.

32:28.690 --> 32:29.490
Director Sun.

32:29.970 --> 32:30.730
Please have a seat.

32:32.730 --> 32:34.000
Regarding the copyright of "Shadows",

32:34.280 --> 32:35.810
what's the deal with that?

32:36.490 --> 32:37.610
About that copyright,

32:38.040 --> 32:40.210
I'm sorry I didn't make things clear for you.

32:42.240 --> 32:43.610
Look at Article 39.

32:45.210 --> 32:46.640
After the copyright of "Shadows" expires,

32:46.930 --> 32:48.570
the copyright of "Shadows",

32:48.810 --> 32:51.450
should be owned by the artist and the Dream Journey Press.

32:51.810 --> 32:54.520
Dream Journey has the right to the final interpretation.

32:55.690 --> 32:57.880
That's why you shared the copyright with me?

32:58.160 --> 32:59.240
So that I'd share

32:59.240 --> 33:01.730
the risk of infringement?

33:02.520 --> 33:03.760
You can go ask around.

33:04.000 --> 33:05.930
Nowadays, no publishing agency

33:06.090 --> 33:08.570
would share the copyright with their artists.

33:08.970 --> 33:09.970
The reason we're doing this

33:10.210 --> 33:11.640
is for your own good.

33:11.810 --> 33:14.400
But you hid the expiration of the copyright from me!

33:16.160 --> 33:18.210
It's clearly written in the contract.

33:23.930 --> 33:25.400
The profits they made out of the "Shadows" comics,

33:25.400 --> 33:27.160
is totally enough for Dream Journey Publishing

33:27.280 --> 33:29.090
to cover the compensation easily.

33:29.570 --> 33:31.040
I get minimal pay for my work,

33:31.490 --> 33:33.360
but I have to take on half of the compensation.

33:34.450 --> 33:36.280
They've planned it all along.

33:36.850 --> 33:39.090
They made a trap and wait for me to jump in.

33:41.240 --> 33:42.240
It's all right.

33:42.640 --> 33:45.160
It's inevitable to be fooled when you are new in the business.

33:45.610 --> 33:46.850
But when they asked you

33:46.850 --> 33:48.360
to share the copyright,

33:48.640 --> 33:50.160
weren't you suspecting at all?

33:51.400 --> 33:53.040
I didn't think that much.

33:53.930 --> 33:55.640
I thought that there are

33:55.880 --> 33:57.450
always good people in the world.

33:58.640 --> 33:59.880
How silly!

34:00.120 --> 34:00.850
Right.

34:01.690 --> 34:03.120
You are the smartest.

34:06.400 --> 34:07.160
Here.

34:08.730 --> 34:10.450
Have a cup of coffee.

34:10.770 --> 34:12.080
Take it easy.

34:13.640 --> 34:14.930
Your latte art

34:16.690 --> 34:18.210
is so bad!

34:21.120 --> 34:22.930
I'm not a professional.

34:25.250 --> 34:26.450
Try it yourself if you're that good.

34:28.600 --> 34:29.600
Why not?

34:38.560 --> 34:39.530
Do it.

34:39.770 --> 34:40.800
How should I start?

34:45.120 --> 34:46.250
Hold the coffee in your left hand,

34:47.839 --> 34:49.120
and hold the milk in your right hand.

34:50.530 --> 34:53.050
Pour slowly little by little from this angle.

34:53.050 --> 34:54.319
Don't rush.

35:11.840 --> 35:12.560
What?

35:12.560 --> 35:14.450
I see that now. I'll do it myself.

35:20.210 --> 35:21.050
Here.

35:31.840 --> 35:33.160
You're adding too much sugar?

35:33.360 --> 35:35.970
The coffee is too bitter. I prefer the sweet.

35:38.880 --> 35:39.770
Give me a sec.

35:42.730 --> 35:43.600
Here.

35:43.840 --> 35:44.770
Wait.

35:45.250 --> 35:46.400
You take a bite of this,

35:46.400 --> 35:47.640
and then try a sip of coffee.

35:56.320 --> 35:57.210
How is it?

35:59.120 --> 36:00.290
Delicious.

36:01.080 --> 36:02.050
Wait.

36:07.400 --> 36:08.640
Got a stamp on you.

36:25.160 --> 36:26.450
Are you happy now?

36:30.800 --> 36:32.640
Thank you for cheering me up.

36:35.490 --> 36:36.800
So what are you going to do next?

36:39.160 --> 36:41.250
I want to talk to the original author.

36:42.010 --> 36:44.210
It is best to settle this in private.

36:45.800 --> 36:47.770
But there is another thing that is also very important.

36:48.080 --> 36:49.560
You are also a victim of this.

36:50.010 --> 36:50.930
So,

36:51.450 --> 36:53.770
while you talk to the original author,

36:54.210 --> 36:55.400
you'd better also look for

36:55.730 --> 36:58.490
any evidence that the publisher lied to you.

36:59.250 --> 37:01.010
Do you have the contract you signed

37:01.010 --> 37:02.210
or chat records or anything like that?

37:02.400 --> 37:03.360
I'll help you.

37:06.400 --> 37:08.490
I can do it myself.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.930
I know you're worried about me.

37:11.800 --> 37:13.050
But I also have to learn

37:13.250 --> 37:14.800
to solve problems by myself.

37:18.400 --> 37:19.290
Okay.

37:19.690 --> 37:21.840
But what if you can't find any evidence?

37:22.120 --> 37:24.120
Then I'll pay for the compensation.

37:25.250 --> 37:26.050
How much is that?

37:27.730 --> 37:28.840
500,000 yuan.

37:31.690 --> 37:33.560
Don't worry. It's not gonna get that far.

37:34.250 --> 37:35.880
At the worst,

37:36.690 --> 37:38.880
you could hire me.

38:02.880 --> 38:03.840
Professor Ye.

38:04.360 --> 38:06.840
I think I should see Mr. Chen of Hongguang.

38:10.050 --> 38:10.800
Have you been waiting for a long time?

38:10.800 --> 38:11.530
Give me.

38:11.770 --> 38:12.400
No.

38:12.770 --> 38:13.600
Sorry.

38:13.600 --> 38:14.360
It's okay.

38:16.690 --> 38:17.970
I saw your performance

38:18.160 --> 38:19.120
at the competition.

38:20.050 --> 38:20.840
But

38:21.800 --> 38:24.930
you rejected me before,

38:25.400 --> 38:26.290
didn't you?

38:28.600 --> 38:29.450
Yes.

38:30.210 --> 38:31.530
I thought,

38:31.880 --> 38:33.880
that I didn't share the same ideas as you.

38:34.250 --> 38:35.800
So I chose to refuse.

38:37.120 --> 38:38.560
Then why now,

38:39.120 --> 38:40.600
you come to me?

38:41.690 --> 38:43.160
Because I need money.

38:50.970 --> 38:51.930
You are very straight-forward.

38:53.970 --> 38:54.930
To be honest,

38:55.400 --> 38:56.690
before,

38:57.400 --> 39:00.120
I just wanted to buy out your robot patent.

39:01.160 --> 39:03.320
But now I've changed my mind.

39:05.560 --> 39:06.970
I want your patent

39:07.490 --> 39:11.160
plus a two-year contract after your graduation.

39:12.160 --> 39:13.400
Name your price.

39:22.400 --> 39:23.490
500,000 yuan.

39:23.490 --> 39:24.400
Si Yue.

39:29.320 --> 39:30.490
If it's okay,

39:31.360 --> 39:32.970
I want the money now.

39:35.290 --> 39:36.930
Don't be so hasty, young man,

39:37.640 --> 39:38.800
we still have to wait,

39:39.050 --> 39:41.050
for the procedures of the contract, don't we?

39:41.450 --> 39:42.290
Okay.

39:42.840 --> 39:43.970
Then I'll be waiting.

40:01.770 --> 40:02.970
Hello?

40:03.010 --> 40:04.840
Hello, Ding Xian.

40:04.840 --> 40:06.730
I've got your 500,000 yuan.

40:06.730 --> 40:08.600
I'll clarify the plagiarism case for you

40:08.600 --> 40:10.450
on Weibo in a moment.

40:10.450 --> 40:11.400
Don't worry.

40:12.560 --> 40:14.800
But I didn't send you any money.

40:15.640 --> 40:18.210
A gentleman contacted me yesterday,

40:18.210 --> 40:19.490
saying that he'll help you with the money.

40:19.490 --> 40:20.560
Don't you know that?

40:21.080 --> 40:22.210
So... could you tell me,

40:22.210 --> 40:24.400
the name of that man?

40:55.530 --> 40:56.320
Su,

40:56.320 --> 40:57.640
I've been looking all over for you.

41:01.600 --> 41:02.530
Xianxian,

41:03.490 --> 41:04.530
why are you here?

41:07.400 --> 41:08.840
Thank you for paying the money for me.

41:09.970 --> 41:11.560
I'll pay you back as soon as possible.

41:15.080 --> 41:16.120
That's...

41:17.600 --> 41:18.930
That's the only thing I can do for you.

41:23.930 --> 41:25.400
Su, are you all right?

41:26.880 --> 41:28.050
Are you okay?

41:28.290 --> 41:29.400
I'm okay. I'm okay.

41:30.010 --> 41:31.320
I'm okay. Just go. See you later.

41:31.320 --> 41:32.770
It's okay. You don't have to worry about me. I'm okay.

41:33.730 --> 41:34.640
What can I do?

41:39.490 --> 41:41.250
Maybe I should just get you home first?

41:52.010 --> 41:52.640
Su.

41:53.400 --> 41:53.930
Su.

41:53.930 --> 41:55.120
Can you get up?

41:58.530 --> 41:59.320
Be careful!

42:06.250 --> 42:07.560
Where are you going, young lady?

42:08.210 --> 42:09.120
Just a minute, sir.

42:10.010 --> 42:10.770
Su.

42:11.450 --> 42:12.880
Su, where do you live?

42:13.600 --> 42:14.250
Su?

42:14.320 --> 42:15.250
Jiangnan Avenue.

42:16.120 --> 42:17.160
Jiangnan Avenue.

42:17.490 --> 42:18.250
All right.

42:37.250 --> 42:38.360
Here we are, young lady.

42:41.930 --> 42:42.690
Su.

42:43.210 --> 42:44.120
Wake up!

42:44.640 --> 42:46.320
Jiangnan Avenue and?

42:46.730 --> 42:48.560
Hey, young lady, are you getting off or not?

42:50.530 --> 42:51.490
What should I do?

43:01.770 --> 43:03.210
Su, we're there.

43:03.640 --> 43:04.530
You...

43:09.360 --> 43:10.640
Su, you are too heavy!

43:14.800 --> 43:15.730
Su.

43:17.010 --> 43:18.080
You're drunk!

43:29.840 --> 43:31.560
If I weren't drunk,

43:33.530 --> 43:36.080
I'd never be able to say this.

43:41.800 --> 43:42.640
Ding Xian,

43:48.530 --> 43:49.640
I love you.

43:51.800 --> 43:52.640
Su.

43:54.970 --> 43:57.290
I'm already in a relationship.

44:30.250 --> 44:31.450
I see.

44:38.080 --> 44:39.290
Sorry about that.

44:45.770 --> 44:47.160
You should go home and get some rest.

45:14.160 --> 45:15.120
Zhou Siyue.

45:15.880 --> 45:17.050
Zhou Siyue.

46:01.880 --> 46:02.730
Director Su,

46:02.930 --> 46:04.210
there is someone waiting for you in your office.

46:17.800 --> 46:18.770
Zhou Siyue.

46:31.560 --> 46:33.210
There is 500,000 yuan in this card.

46:33.930 --> 46:35.320
The password is Ding Xian's birthday.

46:43.160 --> 46:44.560
Please tell Xianxian,

46:46.560 --> 46:47.600
I'm sorry.

46:50.490 --> 46:51.730
What did you do to her?

46:57.320 --> 46:58.400
I am warning you.

47:00.320 --> 47:01.690
Leave her alone!

47:04.640 --> 47:06.530
I'm about to lose my patience.
